    {
      "id": "msg_0677_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Huh? You... Aren’t you nearby?\r",
        "Why not come here and just talk to me\n",
        "face-to-face?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0677_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you remember my\n",
        "sweet {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0}?\r",
        "{STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} runs very fast.\r",
        "It’s exhilarating to ride on its\n",
        "back when it really gets going.\r",
        "Bye-bye!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0677_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, have you ever seen a {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}\n",
        "before?\r",
        "I just battled one...\n",
        "It was much faster than I expected.\r",
        "I was a little shocked.\n",
        "I still won, of course.\r",
        "Bye-bye!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0677_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Oh, I just saw a wild {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\n",
        "I was trying to catch it when I\f",
        "noticed that I was all out of\f",
        "Poké Balls.\r",
        "If you don’t check your items, you\n",
        "may run out at the worst time.\f",
        "I hope you learn from my mistake.\r",
        "Bye-bye!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0677_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you want to battle? I’m going to win\n",
        "this time!\r",
        "I’ll be waiting for you around\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}. Look for me, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0677_00011",
      "en_US": [
